# Whitelist: this folder also holds lecture notes, so only homework folders are tracked.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/hw*/

# Datasets, caches and environments (reproducible via each homework's README)
**/chest_xray/
**/archive.zip
**/cache/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.remember/

# Large or personal artifacts
*.pt
**/results_both_classes/
**/Homework_*
**/ece285dga_*.pdf
**/CODE_GUIDELINES.md

# LaTeX build files (the final PDF is kept)
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
